WEBVTT

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:19.740
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.640
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.450
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.900
Who I wanna be. {naritai atashi}

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.150
They call me calm, strong, and cool. {cool de tsuyoku...}

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:40.500
Everyone says I'm popular.{iketeru to...}

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.910
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all. {honto wa...}

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:47.120
I'm just an ordinary girl! {futsuu ni...}

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:51.230
I wish I could just get rid {puressha nank...}

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:55.010
of all this pressure and be myself. {sunao ni naritai...}

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.850
But they'd all say it's out of character. {kyarajanai toka...}

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:03.260
Unlock my heart! {atashi no kokoro...}

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:08.610
Just be who you wanna be. {naritai...}

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.460
Your Guardian Characters are with you. {shugo kyara ga...}

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.710
Just do it the way you wanna do it. {yaritai...}

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:18.780
It'll be okay, really! {zenzen...}

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:23.690
Just be who you wanna be. {naritai...}

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:26.460
Having only one style would be way too boring. {hitotsu...}

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:30.720
Just do it the way you wanna do it. {yaritai...}

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.990
You can do anything! {nandatte...}

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:36.610
I know that...{kitto}

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.450
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.340
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.210
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.520
...is who I wanna be. {naritai atashi}

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:53.680
I did some checking up on Nikaidou-sensei, but what's in his resumé is mostly false.

00:01:54.110 --> 00:01:56.110
It looks like he quit working here, too.

00:01:56.180 --> 00:02:00.370
That means Nikaidou-sensei really is one of Easter's people,

00:02:00.530 --> 00:02:04.020
and he wanted to turn everyone's eggs into X Eggs for them.

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:08.320
Jeez! I can't believe he did whatever he wanted and got away with it!

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:15.990
I'm just glad it wasn't Ikuto.

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:18.850
What? Why am I relieved about that?

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:21.110
Amu-chan, is something wrong?

00:02:21.170 --> 00:02:22.960
No, nothing, not a thing.

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:23.760
Really?

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:28.870
I'll fix them all! {XXX p.3 ln.9+Star: FLASHBACK to ep #13}

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:32.790
I haven't seen him at all since then.

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:38.080
I wonder what he's doing.

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:44.000
Happy and Embarrassing First Date!

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:44.000
Episode 18

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:50.110
Before I forget, do you guys have any plans for this Sunday?

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:51.510
Not particularly.

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:52.750
Why?

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:56.450
Well, I got some free passes to the aquarium.

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:59.140
Oh, they just built that place!

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:01.540
I'm so happy! I've been wanting to see it.

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:03.110
Well, it's decided then.

00:03:03.170 --> 00:03:05.020
Are you free as well, Hinamori-san?

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:06.150
Of course!

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:07.920
Yeah! Oh...

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:10.910
S-Since everyone else says they want to go, I guess there's no reason not to.

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:14.620
There it is! Amu-chi's famous "cool & spicy" character!

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.600
What do you mean by famous?

00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:18.440
I love it!

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:19.670
Me, too!

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:22.250
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:21.420
The aquarium!

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.130
I can't wait to see it!

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:27.340
It's great weather for going to the aquarium!

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:33.350
The aquarium! The aquarium! Our first time at the aquarium!

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:37.910
There's something nice about visiting the aquarium with friends. I'm excited.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:39.360
Hinamori-san!

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:42.900
Good morning. Sorry for making you wait.

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:45.540
It's okay, no one else is here yet.

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:49.590
Actually, just before I left the house I got calls from everyone...

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:53.990
I'm sorry, I can't get out of dance practice after all.

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:58.760
Sorry, Tadase! I have to go out with my family all of a sudden.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:01.980
Sorry. A soccer match suddenly came up.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:04.290
So the others can't come.

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:06.170
What?

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:08.640
I was really looking forward to it, too.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:10.990
Good-bye, aquarium.

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:12.330
Good-bye, dolphins.

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:16.290
It can't be helped, so let's just go together.

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:16.930
Huh?

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:18.580
Ah, the bus is here.

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:26.190
I'm alone with Tadase-kun?!

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:29.260
Calm down, Amu-chan.

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:35.720
Hey, Ikuto.

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.210
Wake up, Ikuto.

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:40.690
No. I'm super sleepy.

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:45.300
You've been acting funny lately. Something's strange.

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:47.290
Is it because of her?

00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:49.410
Hinamori Amu.

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:51.950
I won't lose to you! {XXX p.8 ln.33 FLASHBACK to ep ??}

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:58.460
Are you paying attention to her because she has the lock that goes with your key?

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:00.250
Or is it...

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:09.590
Hey, by key do you mean that?

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:17.000
What's the lock? What happens when you put the lock and the key together-nya?

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:18.900
I have no idea.

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:26.890
A lock and key... Could be fun-nya.

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:31.180
Gentlemen, this girl is your target-nya!

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:33.200
Go find her-nya!

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:46.210
I-I can't believe I-I'm really alone with Tadase-kun!

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:47.840
We are here as well.

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:49.650
She's totally forgotten about us.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:50.670
Amu-chan.

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:53.150
Where are the dolphins?

00:05:55.350 --> 00:05:56.870
Do you want to see what's over there?

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:58.880
Sure, let's go look.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:04.740
Whoa, a date. B-But wait...

00:06:04.820 --> 00:06:08.720
Wouldn't this also be considered a date?

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:13.540
{06:10} Congratulations! First Date!

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:11.890
God, is it okay,

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:13.850
for such a wonderful development to happen to me?

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:18.550
His hair's so silky.

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:19.770
His eyes are so pretty.

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:21.740
He's majorly cute again today.

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:24.050
Hinamori-san.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:25.340
Yes?

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:27.080
I mean, what?

00:06:27.350 --> 00:06:28.470
Shall we go?

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:32.790
Yeah!

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.600
The mood is good!

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:47.370
It's so big!

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:48.260
Yeah.

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:54.310
Hey, you guys!

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:27.070
Oh man, this is so much fun!

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:28.630
Everything is so adorable!

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:30.840
Now let's see the dolphins!

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:32.460
Right, what should we see next?

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:35.140
Oh no, I'm getting carried away!

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:39.000
That's not like me. Tadase-kun will think I'm childish!

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:41.270
But wait, the girl he likes...

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:44.700
I've never met anyone like her; {XXX p.17 ln.74 FLASHBACK to ep. 11}

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:46.500
a girl like Amulet Heart.

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:51.000
In that case, maybe I should just transform into Amulet Heart.

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:53.990
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:56.590
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:59.510
Yay! Yay!

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:01.970
There's a really tacky cheerleader here.

00:08:02.010 --> 00:08:03.420
Why is she at an aquarium?

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:07.190
Okay, there's no way I could do that.

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:08.310
Hey!

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:11.960
Hinamori-san, isn't it about time you returned to this world?

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:17.670
I'm sorry. I was acting weird, wasn't I?

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:19.120
Like, not my usual-

00:08:19.170 --> 00:08:20.240
I'm glad you're having fun.

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:22.160
I was worried.

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:28.340
It's the first time I've ever been alone with a girl like this.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:32.080
I didn't want things to be dull or boring.

00:08:32.730 --> 00:08:34.100
Tadase-kun.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:38.230
And since it was you, Hinamori-san...

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:39.290
What?

00:08:39.730 --> 00:08:41.980
Because you're...

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:45.860
Because I'm Amulet Heart?

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:48.860
Hinamori-san, I...

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:52.590
Huh?

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.520
W-Who are you?

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:25.880
So Hinamori Amu is here-nya?

00:09:26.610 --> 00:09:30.360
Good work-nya. As a reward, here's some catnip-nya!

00:09:31.110 --> 00:09:35.420
I can't wait to see what's going to happen-nya!

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:41.010
Onii-chan, hurry, hurry!

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:43.860
She's really taken a liking to you.

00:09:44.090 --> 00:09:46.800
This is troublesome. I wonder if she's lost.

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:51.110
What's wrong?

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:56.360
Are you two going out? Is she your girlfriend?

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:59.270
Of courst not, we're just friends!

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:01.020
That's right, just friends!

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:02.030
Just friends?

00:10:02.090 --> 00:10:06.220
I'm so glad, because I love you!

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:12.710
Why you little brat...

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:14.470
What are you getting so worked up about?

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:15.690
It's pathetic.

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:18.790
We haven't gone to see the dolphins.

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:23.500
That looks tasty-nya.

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:26.790
Onii-chan, you're really cool!

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:28.040
Thanks.

00:10:29.180 --> 00:10:30.750
Give me a break!

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:36.250
You know what? This morning, on TV, I saw Saeki Nobuko's Lucky Colors Fortune-Telling.

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:41.670
She said my destined partner will be wearing black shoes and a beige coat.

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:44.000
So you're my destined partner!

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:45.460
Um, what should we do?

00:10:46.820 --> 00:10:48.720
Her parents must be looking for her.

00:10:48.810 --> 00:10:51.580
We should take her to the Lost Children Center.

00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:56.780
W-What?

00:11:02.820 --> 00:11:07.000
You're a bad lady who wants to break us up!

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:10.460
But our love can beat anything!

00:11:10.510 --> 00:11:11.280
Huh?

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:15.890
Amu-chan, Amu-chan!

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:20.120
What is it? Is it already time for the dolphin show?

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:21.510
No, it's not that!

00:11:21.560 --> 00:11:22.620
Look!

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:31.650
A-An X Egg!

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:45.720
Why is it here?

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:47.190
What should we do, Tadase-kun?

00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:49.540
What is it? What's wrong?

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:52.070
We have to catch it!

00:11:53.570 --> 00:11:55.450
Onii-chan, don't go!

00:11:55.530 --> 00:11:56.530
Chisa-chan.

00:11:56.740 --> 00:12:00.330
Leave this to me. You have to take care of her.

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:04.560
Hinamori-san.

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.880
That looks so tasty-nya!

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:15.960
Hinamori Amu, I've found you-nya!

00:12:16.070 --> 00:12:18.760
Amu-chan, Character Transform!

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:19.500
But...

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:21.940
I can't do that here, with so many people around!

00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:24.020
Then Character Change!

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:25.670
Right, that I can do!

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:30.040
Hop! Step! Jump!

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:38.340
We're just going to borrow this for a while!

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:39.970
Hey!

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:41.270
Jeez!

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:43.210
Wait!

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:48.000
It's as if...

00:12:48.070 --> 00:12:49.770
I get the feeling it's making fun of us.

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:51.340
That makes me mad!

00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:53.720
Hinamori Amu-

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:54.420
Hey, watch out!

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:55.210
Huh?

00:12:55.590 --> 00:12:57.020
Ouch...

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:59.380
Why are you here?

00:12:59.510 --> 00:13:00.900
Does that mean Ikuto's here, too?

00:13:00.970 --> 00:13:05.890
Ikuto isn't with me. I'm a stray cat character who loves his freedom-nya.

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:07.710
Quit trying to act cool.

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:09.170
He kind of is, though.

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:09.960
What?

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:13.990
Have you been overcome by my charm?

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:18.360
Are you okay?

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:20.300
I-I'm fine-nya.

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:23.940
That's...

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:28.930
This is the key that can open your lock-nya.

00:13:29.590 --> 00:13:32.690
The key that can open the Humpty Lock?

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:36.960
It's pretty!

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:44.480
The design looks pretty similar.

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:46.190
They go together.

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:47.670
I'll open the lock-nya.

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:49.060
Okay.

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:03.130
What is it now?

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:05.400
Maybe it's mad because you were ignoring it.

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:08.820
The key is gone!

00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:14.160
Ikuto's going to be so mad.

00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:16.590
Ikuto? That was Ikuto's?

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:22.280
Why would Ikuto have the key that opens my lock?

00:14:22.400 --> 00:14:23.490
Amu-chan!

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:27.310
Hold on! Time out!

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:32.630
Ikuto?

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:40.800
Ikuto!

00:14:40.930 --> 00:14:43.980
Jeez, taking off with someone else's stuff...

00:14:44.050 --> 00:14:45.600
Here's your punishment.

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:47.250
I'll get the key back.

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:52.980
Did Ikuto save me?

00:14:53.060 --> 00:14:54.660
Amu-chan, let's go, too!

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:55.380
Yeah!

00:14:57.670 --> 00:15:00.400
My heart: Unlock!

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:40.880
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:15:50.870 --> 00:15:51.970
Amu.

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:58.890
Good. I won't stand out in my Character Transformation here!

00:15:58.940 --> 00:16:00.350
Okay!

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:03.220
You're going to get the key back, right? I'll help you.

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:06.030
Why? I thought you hated me.

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:08.650
What? Hate you? Oh...

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:12.800
I hate you. I hate you! {XXX p.41 ln.180+ FLASHBACK to ?? ep}

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:15.730
Back then, I...

00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:18.020
You're right. This is just in return for saving me earlier,

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:23.460
otherwise I'd have no reason to want to help you.

00:16:25.800 --> 00:16:27.810
I really do hate you!

00:16:28.570 --> 00:16:32.190
Whatever. We better move fast before it takes off.

00:16:32.350 --> 00:16:34.200
Oh yeah, I forgot.

00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:41.430
Chisa-chan, is your mother or father here?

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:45.730
Don't mention my parents!

00:16:45.830 --> 00:16:48.660
I don't need my mother or father anymore.

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:49.630
What?

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:52.070
As long as you're with me, everything is fine.

00:16:52.140 --> 00:16:54.970
Let's go live by ourselves in a far-off city.

00:16:55.020 --> 00:16:55.930
Hold on now...

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:00.310
I won't let you escape this time!

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:13.840
Jeez, it never quits moving!

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:14.940
Amu-chan!

00:17:14.990 --> 00:17:16.760
Stay calm.

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:22.240
Ikuto.

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:25.490
Ikuto will distract it so you can hit it. {lit: "corner it, and you aim there", but it's not exactly cornered in the big blue sky}

00:17:25.530 --> 00:17:26.600
Got it!

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:37.210
Now! The X Egg's not paying attention to us!

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:37.970
Right!

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:39.470
Heart Rod!

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:44.920
Spiral Heart!

00:17:54.660 --> 00:17:55.900
Got it.

00:17:57.150 --> 00:18:01.740
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:18:07.220 --> 00:18:09.150
Open Heart!

00:18:26.720 --> 00:18:28.280
I got it! I got it!

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:31.100
Nice catch!

00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:33.530
What?

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:42.560
Amu-chan!

00:18:42.650 --> 00:18:43.700
Ikuto!

00:18:52.030 --> 00:18:54.380
D-Don't scare me like that!

00:18:57.260 --> 00:18:58.470
Thanks.

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:01.770
Wait!

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:08.160
Is what Yoru said true? Can that key open my lock?

00:19:08.400 --> 00:19:10.230
What is this lock?

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:17.450
And why do you have the key that opens it?

00:19:17.740 --> 00:19:19.010
I don't know.

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:21.620
The least you could do is tell me.

00:19:21.830 --> 00:19:24.690
You're always like this; you never tell me the important stuff.

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:31.390
Like, why didn't you tell me you weren't the one turning everyone's eggs into X Eggs?

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:34.700
Who cares about that?

00:19:34.760 --> 00:19:36.270
I do!

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:44.750
Aren't you going to thank me for jumping down and saving you?

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:47.150
W-Who'd thank...

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:51.060
Oh no, what is this strange feeling?  {lit: I'm kinda strangely aware of him}

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:52.500
The Dumpty Key.

00:19:52.570 --> 00:19:53.280
What?

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:56.690
It's the key to your Humpty Lock.

00:19:57.220 --> 00:19:58.640
The key to...

00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:01.620
My lock and your key go together?

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:04.220
Hinamori-san!

00:20:04.310 --> 00:20:05.540
Tadase-kun!

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:09.570
Are you okay?

00:20:09.610 --> 00:20:11.030
I'm fine.

00:20:11.800 --> 00:20:13.040
Tsukiyomi Ikuto!

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:15.660
You're looking well, little king.

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:18.560
You're after the lock again!

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:22.240
We'll never give it to you!

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:24.940
I'll protect the Humpty Lock!

00:20:26.550 --> 00:20:28.120
You're so adorable.

00:20:28.260 --> 00:20:29.340
Shut up!

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:32.920
But you know, the lock might not be all I'm after.

00:20:32.990 --> 00:20:33.790
Huh?

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:43.080
Tsukiyomi Ikuto, you're...

00:20:44.070 --> 00:20:44.980
Oh!

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:52.520
See you later, Amu.

00:20:54.530 --> 00:20:55.580
Wait!

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:03.380
I just remembered! What about the girl? What happened to Chisa-chan?

00:21:03.520 --> 00:21:06.020
Oh, I ended up finding her parents.

00:21:06.100 --> 00:21:08.960
No! Onii-chan!

00:21:06.470 --> 00:21:08.980
Though, it was a bit difficult.

00:21:09.610 --> 00:21:13.360
She finally calmed down after I promised to go on a date with her.

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:15.400
That little imp.

00:21:15.470 --> 00:21:16.800
Hey, Amu-chan.

00:21:16.850 --> 00:21:18.950
We've finished taking care of the X Egg, so...

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:20.410
Let's go see the rest of the aquarium!

00:21:20.490 --> 00:21:24.300
We must hurry, before the dolphin show starts!

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:27.180
Right. I can't lose to that kid.

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:29.970
I have to enjoy my first date as much as I can!

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:33.170
Hurry! Hurry!

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:37.290
Let's go, Tadase-kun!

00:21:42.670 --> 00:21:44.590
Tadase, what is the matter?

00:21:44.660 --> 00:21:46.750
Nothing.

00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:53.240
Ch-Chisa-chan?

00:21:53.300 --> 00:21:54.780
What?

00:21:54.870 --> 00:21:59.320
I just... I just couldn't leave you, Tadase!

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:01.980
And she's suddenly calling him by name!

00:22:04.230 --> 00:22:08.080
I give up. I've been defeated.

00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:09.910
Amu-chan, hang in there!

00:22:09.950 --> 00:22:11.280
Her soul!

00:22:10.990 --> 00:22:16.750
The dolphins! The dolphins are getting away!

00:22:11.390 --> 00:22:13.930
As long as I have you, I don't need anything else. {This line is almost totally inaudible under Su's yelling}

00:22:14.950 --> 00:22:15.850
Uh, well... {As is this one}

00:22:16.670 --> 00:22:18.060
My first date...

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:41.890
Unless the world ends, I'll always {sekai ga...}

00:22:41.890 --> 00:22:44.660
love you!  Yeah, you! {suki da yo...}

00:22:44.660 --> 00:22:48.130
'Cause I just love, love, love you! {suki suki suki...}

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:52.860
Sure, I might struggle, but I'm still living. {jitabata...}

00:22:52.860 --> 00:22:55.540
So figure it out already! Yeah, you! {kizukeyo...}

00:22:55.540 --> 00:22:59.180
Even though I love, love, love you, {suki suki suki...}

00:22:59.880 --> 00:23:05.370
I wanna say it but, shoot, I just can't! {iitaikuseni...}

00:23:05.370 --> 00:23:09.490
I wanna show you what's in my heart! {tsutaetai...}

00:23:09.490 --> 00:23:12.920
Oh yes! You're my one true hero. {oh yes!...}

00:23:12.920 --> 00:23:18.080
Being in love's gonna be a bumpy ride.  {koishiterukagiri...}

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:24.010
But keep going! Okay, greenhorn rider? {hashitsuzukero...}

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:29.260
Straight down the path, into the sunset, stronger and stronger. {yuuyake...}

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:38.130
Ride through the wild land of youth. {seishun no...}

00:23:50.250 --> 00:23:53.080
Amu-chan, do you know where my precious keepsake is?

00:23:53.140 --> 00:23:54.240
Where what is?

00:23:54.290 --> 00:23:57.560
Darling, you lost it? But it's our treasure!

00:23:57.620 --> 00:24:01.010
It's such an important memento to us. Where could it have gone?

00:24:01.050 --> 00:24:03.840
How could you go and lose it?! You idiot!

00:24:03.900 --> 00:24:05.610
Who're you calling an idiot?

00:24:06.090 --> 00:24:07.900
You mustn't fight!

00:24:07.950 --> 00:24:09.060
What could it be?

00:24:09.110 --> 00:24:09.910
Beats me.

00:24:10.510 --> 00:24:13.330
Next time on Shugo Chara: Mom and Dad's Memory!

00:24:13.400 --> 00:24:16.460
Amu-chan, please help us look for it.

00:24:16.510 --> 00:24:19.630
Fine, but what the heck  <i>is</i> it?
